  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Efficient workflow </h3> <h1> Add-on »z.CAM Integration« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER TMS, with the <strong>add-on »z.CAM Integration«</strong>, expands the system with powerful interfaces and integrates tool data directly into the workflow. DIN/ISO article characteristics, the integrated 2D and 3D editors, and technology data ensure unambiguous, complete tool definitions. NC program management and more than 25 CAM interfaces enable seamless process integration. Clear tool structures reduce CAM programming and setup times and increase process reliability.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/6/csm_zCAM_Integration_product_067b00c254.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 852
    }
   ],
