  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Add-on »z.CAM Integration« </h3> <h2> Process plus </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The add-on delivers measurable ROI through short lead times.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">The add-on provides centralized, consistent tool data for CAM, NC and manufacturing without version conflicts.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">The add‑on integrates seamlessly into existing systems and scales to meet your requirements.</p>",
