   "header": "<h2> Selection of supported CAM systems </h2>",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/e/csm_ZOLLER-CAM-System_autodesk_powermill_c2fdcfa1b7.webp",
     "alt": "The PowerMill interface provides a direct connection between ZOLLER TMS and the CAM programming software. Tool data and 3D geometries are managed centrally and automatically provided in PowerMill.",
     "w": 376,
     "h": 167,
     "href": "https://www.autodesk.com/"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/1/csm_ZOLLER-CAM-System_topsolid_58be78cf00.webp",
     "alt": "The connection with TopSolid links the tool database and CAM programming. Users can access approved tools and the latest technology data from ZOLLER TMS at any time.",
     "w": 376,
     "h": 167,
     "href": "https://www.topsolid.com/"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/8/csm_ZOLLER-CAM-System_peps_749f7a18b8.webp",
     "alt": "The PEPS integration connects ZOLLER TMS with CAM programming for different types of machining processes. Tool data is managed centrally and provided automatically.",
     "w": 376,
     "h": 167,
     "href": "https://apic.de/"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/b/csm_ZOLLER-CAM-System_siemens_ee72b3958f.webp",
     "alt": "The ZOLLER TMS interface to Siemens NX centrally provides tool data, 3D geometries, and process parameters. This ensures that design, CAM programming, and manufacturing always work with identical tool data.",
     "w": 376,
     "h": 167,
     "href": "https://www.siemens.com/de-de/products/cad-cam-software/"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/d/csm_ZOLLER-CAM-System_virtual_gibbs_648f71fb1d.webp",
