     "w": 376,
     "h": 167,
     "href": "https://www.gibbscam.com/"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/f/csm_ZOLLER-CAM-System_camworks_e762945d8a.webp",
     "alt": "With CAMWorks integration, up-to-date tool data is available directly within the CAM environment. ZOLLER TMS provides a centralized database and reduces the need for manual maintenance.",
